{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42549","headline":"云 · 幸夤逊","name":"云","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"因登巨石知来处，勃勃元生绿藓痕。\n静即等闲藏草木，动时顷刻遍乾坤。\n横天未必朋元恶，捧日还曾瑞至尊。\n不独朝朝在巫峡，楚王何事谩劳魂。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"幸夤逊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42549.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42549","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}